ulated setup plan → setup with allowed inputs only. PASS requires distinct project-local PDF/evidence, exact probe/VCOM bindings and no hidden profile or marketing-name package inference. Preserve ordered raw calls, manifests and hashes.\n\n### REQ-002 — identical-board repair\n\nIntentionally select the other Nordic board once, retain its specific mismatch/refusal, then use server-directed continuation. PASS requires no silent retarget and no readiness grant to the other shard. Preserve refusal/remedy/continuation and both identities.\n\n### REQ-003 — validation and lifecycle\n\nRun safety refresh, validate, status, connect, board-info and disconnect for both. PASS requires separate code/UART readiness, distinct J-Link/VCOM routing, no leakage, and clean disconnect. Preserve raw responses and final status.\n\nSeed is only the wrong-board choice. Require schema-valid result/report and raw evidence. PASS requires both genuinely fresh shards.\n"}]}}
